            "description_html": "<b>RK International CK-9305, Simple Solid Brass Cabinet Door Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe think that the Ridged Edge Cabinet Knob is the perfect finishing touch for nearly every kitchen, bathroom, or dresser drawer. Because of its simple appearance, this cabinet door pull can easily blend into almost any decor simply by selecting one of the 5 available finishes. Made by RK International, this simple solid brass cabinet knob is an easy way to make any small door or drawer look polished.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CK-9305 Solid Knob with Flat Edge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-G55G1_size.gif?v=1704354738\" width=\"600\" height=\"146\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
